            <trans-unit id="99">
                <source>seb.integration.description</source>
                <target>This export popup can be embedded directly into any Twig page of a host Symfony project, via the %function% function provided by this bundle. No extra CSS or JS to load on the host side: assets (styles, Stimulus) load only on the first call of the function on the page, and the popup content (columns, filters) loads only when the trigger is clicked.</target>
            </trans-unit>
