            <trans-unit id="101">
                <source>seb.integration.argument_hint</source>
                <target>The 1st argument (required) is this export's UUID. The 2nd argument (optional) customizes the trigger link's label — it accepts HTML (e.g. an icon). The 3rd argument (optional) is an options object: "class" adds CSS classes to the link (it ships unstyled), "detailed" (default true) shows or hides each column's technical property name in the Colonnes step, and "id" restricts the export to one id or an array of ids of the exported entity.</target>
